License, Version 1.1, ALv2 Future License (FSL-1.1-ALv2); see LICENSE.md.

This product contains algorithms adapted from rocjitsu, AMD's GPU
emulator (https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-systems/tree/develop/emulation/rocjitsu;
https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-systems/blob/develop/emulation/rocjitsu/LICENSE.md):

- the fixed-point cubics of gfx1201's f32 transcendental unit (v_rcp_f32,
  v_rsq_f32, v_sqrt_f32, v_log_f32, v_exp_f32), with their coefficient
  tables, in crates/thin-emu/src/machine/trans32/mod.rs;
- the alignment and rounding of gfx1201's float dot unit (v_dot2_f32_bf16
  and the f16 / bf16 WMMA steps), in crates/thin-emu/src/machine/dot.rs.

thin's implementations are its own, in Rust, and were checked bit for bit
on gfx1201 hardware. The one-ULP fix-up tables of
crates/thin-emu/src/machine/trans32/fixups.rs were measured by thin.

